  "limits": [
    "The actual original 20 words with repeated emissions, full sorted rough tails and ordinary excess are supplied with compact uniformly smooth dyadic charts at every order. The positive sieve uses all its physical moduli at tuple cap 2N and the true target N; its density, coprime correction, one genuine signed PP and small-prime terms are explicit.",
